{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-rb:000043:note_appended:bob-cli-rb:2db89d38a4ddfc2c7eb0c061cf998d1760f5d528538b690ebdb10fc01ecde1b1","timestamp":"2026-11-28T02:10:26Z","actor":"bob-cli-rb.land","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-rb","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Land verification (bob-cli-rb.land). STEP 1: All 5 phases closed. Re-read every child note and the plan against source. bob-cli 421de94d (rb.1): capture.type_leads loader in config/capture.rs with per-entry degradation, reserved-clock-key and normalized-duplicate skips, the 64-char/one-line/control checks, and the two-probe parse_for_editor validation; bob types lead field plus stale-key/invalid warnings; rename config_reference guard; docs. bd6a5fe5 (rb.2): TaskTypeLead model (skip_serializing_if); build-only lead loading (build_for_shell passes None); gates 1-4 incl. first-physical-line geometry, route-aware D0/D1 probe with Directive-span rejection; template_completion_gate strips leads; render ' · types \"Fix\"'; capture.md + json-outputs.md docs; 11 CLI tests covering the worked table, hidden exact, shell, write-path, and capture-related band. rb.2's fix of rb.1's probe-body bug and the YAML backslash-continuation tests is confirmed in source. bob-mac-capture 1a5723d2 (rb.3 decode/hint/footer/VoiceOver), plus 1e83e9ce/4192581e/de954c51 (rb.4): two native undo groups bound to completionDraftSnapshot and the response cursor, TypeLeadPeel arm/consume/disarm, includeLead:false on accept-and-capture, docs, hosted tests. 6c545f23 fixed rb.3's out-of-order meetings flake; macOS CI is green on run 46091145714 per the rb.4 note. chezmoi be8a4676 (rb.5) carries the five-lead capture block. Reviewer decisions (no decisions/glossary memory) honored: no memory edits. STEP 2: Commits since 421de94d (69f8aae6, 3deb0bd3, 5b2c5306, 7d48b7b2, d117d288, f0ee4357, befff97c, 31fe1637) touch prose/bank/pomodoro_close/task_blocks/tests. 7d48b7b2 only reformatted a type_leads unit test to a raw string. None conflict with or duplicate type leads, and Mac master has only epic commits since 1a5723d2. Integration edit: moved the cheap subject==new && leading gate to attach_leads' call site, dropping two params and clearing the epic's only clippy::too_many_arguments warning (task_types.rs:361). just check EXIT=0 before (11m22s) and after (9m41s) the edit. FOLLOW-UPS: rb.1 PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP (baseline clippy filter_map_bool_then/useless_format in prose/convert/inline.rs) DECLINED, already resolved on master: just check runs clippy with both lints denied and passes, after the bob-cli-qj landing commits (46885dbf 'green the canonical gate for extract and inline' et seq). No other PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP notes. The plan's out-of-scope '@route^id@ #f refused:null' was pre-tracked by the plan and needs no new task. epic-symbols: none."}}
